WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:03.720
If you need a hall pass, let me know now

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:05.200
before we get started please.

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:08.460
School choice is a hot-button issue, but I fear that

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:10.590
much of the back-and-forth misses the

00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:12.780
real promise of school choice. The

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:14.910
real promise of school choice is not

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:16.500
the assurance that it will somehow

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.359
magically raise reading and math scores.

00:00:18.359 --> 00:00:20.789
Though, let me note, that the most

00:00:20.789 --> 00:00:22.680
rigorous evaluations of charter schools

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:25.529
suggest that their students do as well

00:00:25.529 --> 00:00:27.720
or better than their peers. The real

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:29.670
promise of school choice is the

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:32.610
opportunity for educators to create the

00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:34.469
kinds of schools that can best serve

00:00:34.469 --> 00:00:36.149
their kids in today's America.

00:00:36.149 --> 00:00:39.780
Reform-minded educators, who are trying

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:42.450
to create new programs or launch new

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:44.550
schools in a traditional system, run into

00:00:44.550 --> 00:00:46.410
a wall presented by school boards and

00:00:46.410 --> 00:00:48.809
central administrators, and wary

00:00:48.809 --> 00:00:51.989
communities. This is frustrating, it can be

00:00:51.989 --> 00:00:53.730
intimidating, and it's frequently a

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:56.399
dead-end. School choice is not an attack

00:00:56.399 --> 00:00:58.800
on traditional public education. It's an

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:01.410
attempt to empower educators and an

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:03.719
invitation to create the kinds of

00:01:03.720 --> 00:01:06.400
schools that we need in the 21st century.

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.939
To learn more about my take on school

00:01:08.939 --> 00:01:10.619
choice, check the links in the

00:01:10.619 --> 00:01:12.990
description below. Also, let us know what

00:01:12.990 --> 00:01:15.180
other topics you'd like a AEI scholars to

00:01:15.180 --> 00:01:18.650
cover in 60 seconds.

